{{Quote|Allows the user to turn into a hulking snow beast with cold attacks and ground-shaking strength.|Shop}}
'''Yeti''' is a {{Mythical}} [[Beast]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|5,000,000}} or {{Robux|3,000}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

Yeti grants the user the ability to manipulate and imbue their attacks with ice and such into powerful and violent attacks along with transforming into the mythological {{w|Yeti}}, enhancing their already powerful and dangerous attacks even more, along with granting additional perks such as damage reduction and freezing any water into ice platforms they or their attacks touch.

